sentences.text:
9. Let the applicant Constable Ashish Yadav S/o Indradev Yadav be released on bail in the aforesaid 139 of 2021, under section 294 of 2022, under section 376 IPC and section 3/4, Protection of Children from Sexual Offences (POCSO) Act, P.S. Lonar, District Hardoi, on his furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of Magistrate/Court concerned, subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.
10.

